return ['domain'=>'zinn-offload','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-offload','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:46+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:46+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Media Offload'=>'Zinn® Media Offload','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload','Moves this site\'s media library to Zinn® object storage and serves it from a CDN. Configured from your Zinn® dashboard — no access key is ever typed into WordPress.'=>'Yana matsar da laburaren kafofin watsa labarai na wannan shafin zuwa ma\'ajiyar abu ta Zinn® kuma yana ba da shi daga CDN. An saita shi daga allon kula ku na Zinn® - ba a taba buga mabudin shiga ba a cikin WordPress.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'An adana shi. Rubuta sabon ƙima don maye gurbin sa.','Filter this list…'=>'Tace wannan lissafin...','Filter this list'=>'Tace wannan jerin','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Babu abin da ya dace da wannan matatar.','Add a row'=>'Ƙara safa','Remove this row'=>'Cire wannan jere','Remove'=>'Cire','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — bayyani','Overview'=>'Bayani Gaba Daya','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kowane Zinn® plugin a wannan rukunin yanar gizon, da kuma ko yana aiki.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Babu buƙatar haɗin intanet don wannan plugin ɗin.','Open settings'=>'Bude saituna','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ba ka da izinin canza waɗannan saitunan.','Settings sections'=>'Sassan saituna','Support'=>'Taimako','Save changes'=>'Ajiye canje-canje','Tools'=>'Kayan aiki','Export settings'=>'Fitowar da saituna','Reset to defaults'=>'Sake wa ga tsari na asali','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Wannan zai dawo da duk wani tsari na wannan plugin zuwa asalin sa. A ci gaba?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Binciken matsala don tallafi','Import a settings file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin saiti','Import'=>'Shigo da shi','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Fayilolin da aka fitar ba sa ƙunshe da kalmomin sirri, alamomi (tokens) ko maɓallan API - za ku buƙaci shigar da su sake a sabon shafin.','Settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kowane saiti a kan wannan plugin ya dawo zuwa tsohuwar sigarsa.','Done.'=>'An gama.','That action is not available.'=>'Wannan aikin ba ya samuwa.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ba za a iya karanta wannan fayil ɗin ba. Zaɓi fayil ɗin saituna da aka fitar daga wani kari na Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil din yayi girma sosai don ya zama fitar da saituna.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ba fitarwa ba ce ta saitunan Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'An fitar da wannan fayil ɗin ne daga wani mabambancin plugin (%s), don haka shigo da shi nan zai adana saitunan da wannan plugin ɗin bai fahimta ba.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'An shigo da saiti %d. Ba a taba shigar da kalmomin sirri da madogaran API a cikin fitarwa ba, don haka a sake shigar da su.' . "\0" . 'An shigo da saituna %d. Kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API ba sa cikin fitarwa, don haka a sake shigar da su.','Zinn Digital® did not return a token. Nothing has been changed on this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® bai dawo da wani alama ba. Ba a canza komai ba a kan wannan shafin.','This site is no longer connected to Zinn® media offload. New uploads will stay on this server. Pair it again from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Wannan shafin ba a haɗa shi da sauke kafofin watsa labarai na Zinn® ba kuma. Sabbin loda za su kasance a kan wannan uwar garken. Haɗa shi kuma daga allon kula na Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® answered with HTTP %d.'=>'Zinn Digital® ya bayar da martani tare da HTTP %d.','Disconnected by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Zinn Digital® ta cire haɗin.','Connected'=>'An haɗa','Connecting…'=>'Ana haɗawa...','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'An haɗa, amma wani abu na buƙatar kulawa','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Running on your own account'=>'Ana gudana a kan asusunka','We could not check this'=>'Ba mu iya bincika wannan ba','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Wannan plugin din bai fadi dalili ba. A tura rahoton bincike kuma za mu duba.','Connection status'=>'Matsayin haɗi','Last checked %s ago.'=>'An bincika karshe tun %s.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana budewa a sabon shafin)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Aika da wannan zuwa ga goyon bayan Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Wannan shi neini ainihin abin da za a aika — ba komai ba, kuma babu wani abu da aka ɓoye. Kalmomin sirrinka, alamomin shiga da maɓallan API ɗinka ba sucikin sa.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Rahoton binciken da za a aika','Copy to clipboard'=>'Kwafi zuwa allo','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Aika da wannan rahoton ga goyon bayan Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Muna buɗe tikitin goyon baya a gare ku kuma mu ba da amsa ta imel. Idan kun fi son kada ku aika da shi, kwafi shi a sama sannan ku liƙa shi a cikin tikiti da kanku.','Copied'=>'An kwafi','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ba mu iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba daga wannan uwar garken (%s). Kwafi rahoton da ke sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti maimakon haka — babu abin da ya lalace game da saitunanka.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'An tura rahotonku zuwa ga goyon bayan Zinn® kuma za su ba da amsa ta imel.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Taimakon Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonku — lamba ta tunawa %s — kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Ka aika da rahotanni da yawa a cikin dan kankanin lokaci. Jira \'yan mintoci kaɗan sannan ka sake gwadawa — waɗanda suka gabata sun isa.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ta kasa karɓar rahoton a yanzu — wannan matsala ce ta mu, ba ta ku ba. Sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba, ko kuma ku kwafe rahoton da ke sama zuwa cikin wani tikiti.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'An ƙi amincewa da rahoton (HTTP %d). Kwafi shi a sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti, tare da ambaton wannan lamba.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Boye da wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, madogaransa na kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa da aka gina don mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwancin Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayen da sayar da shafuka da aka kafa, da yankuna, da sanya hanyoyin haɗi, tare da kiyaye kuɗin lafiya har sai bangarorin biyu sun yi farin ciki.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ka ɗauki ma\'aikatan da ke yin wannan a matsayin sana\'a','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwancinmu na masu zaman kansu na duniya: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko buga wani aikin kuma bari su yi gwanjo.','Media Offload'=>'Rabewar Kafofin Watsa Labarai','Connection'=>'Haɗi','What gets moved'=>'Abin da aka matsar','How media is served'=>'Yadda ake yada kafofin watsa labarai','Move a batch now'=>'Matsar da wani rukuni yanzu','Media already moved is never affected by a change here — its address does not change.'=>'Wurin da aka riga aka motsa baya shafa shi da wani canji a nan ba — adireshi ba zai canza ba.','New uploads'=>'Sabbin lodawa','Move new uploads to Zinn® storage as they arrive'=>'Matsar sabbin abubuwan da aka ɗora zuwa wurin ajiya na Zinn® yayin da suka isa','Existing media'=>'Wanzayen kafofin watsa labarai','Keep moving the media library that is already here'=>'Ci gaba da motsa ɗakin karatu na kafofin watsa labarai da ke nan riga','A few files an hour, in the background, picking up where it left off. Turning this off pauses it; nothing already moved comes back.'=>'Fayiloli kaɗan a cikin awa ɗaya, a bango, suna ci gaba daga inda suka tsaya. Kashe wannan zai dakatar da shi; babu abin da aka riga aka matsar da zai dawo.','Files per hourly pass'=>'Fayiloli a kowane awa','Each attachment is several files and every one is a full upload. Raise this on a fast host with a generous execution limit; lower it if passes are being cut short.'=>'Kowanne abin da aka makala fayiloli ne da yawa kuma kowannensu cikakken loda ne. Sanya wannan a kan mai masaukin baki mai sauri tare da iyakar aiwatarwa mai yawa; rage shi idan ana katse hanyoyin.','Leave files smaller than'=>'Bar fayiloli masu ƙanƙanta da','Kilobytes. A tiny icon costs more in the extra connection than it saves in disk, so there is rarely a reason to move one. Set to 0 to move everything.'=>'Iyakokin kilobait. Ƙaramin alama yana kashe kuɗi da yawa a cikin haɗin gwiwa na daban fiye da abin da yake adanawa a cikin diski, saboda haka da wuya a sami dalilin ƙaura ɗaya. Sanya zuwa 0 domin ƙaurar da komai.','Never move these types'=>'Kar a taba matsar da irin waɗannan nau\'ikan','Useful when a plugin reads a file straight off the disk — a font, a PDF a form builder stamps, an audio file a player seeks inside.'=>'Da amfani lokacin da wani kari yake karanta fayil kai tsaye daga kan diski — wani font, wani PDF da mai ginin fom ke sanya wa hatimi, wani fayil na sauti da wani mai kunna kiɗa ke nema a ciki.','These two are the ones to be careful with — read each description before changing it.'=>'Waɗannan biyun su ne waɗanda ya kamata a yi hankali da su — karanta kowane bayani kafin ka canza shi.','Serve from Zinn® storage'=>'Ača daga ma\'ajiyar Zinn®','Point image and file addresses at Zinn® storage'=>'Nuna hotuna da adireshin fayil zuwa wurin ajiyar Zinn®','Off, files are uploaded but still served from this server — which is the safe state while you check everything arrived. On, visitors are served from storage and this server stops carrying the traffic.'=>'A kashe, fayilolin sun loda amma har yanzu ana ba da su daga wannan sabar — wanda shine yanayin aminci yayin da kuke bincika komai ya iso. A kunne, ana ba da baƙi daga wurin ajiyewa kuma wannan sabar ta daina ɗaukar zirga-zirgar.','Free the disk space'=>'Saki sararin faifai','Delete the local copy once every size has uploaded'=>'Goge kwafin da ke kan kwamfuta da zarar an loda kowane girma','This is the point of offloading, and it is also the irreversible half. Leave it off until “Serve from Zinn® storage” is on and you have checked your site — a local copy is the only thing that saves you if something was missed.'=>'Wannan ita ce ma\'anar saukarwa, kuma ita ce kuma rabin da ba a iya jujjuya shi. Bar shi a kashe har sai "Serve from Zinn® storage" ya kunna kuma ka duba shafinka - kwafin na gida shine kawai abin da zai cece ka idan an rasa wani abu.','Deleting local copies cannot be undone from this screen. Take a backup first — the Zinn® Connector plugin can do that for you.'=>'Ba za a iya dawo da kofe na gida da aka goge ba daga wannan allon. Yi madadin aiki tukuna — Zinn® Connector plugin zai iya yi muku hakan.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage yet, so there is nowhere to move media to.'=>'Wannan shafin ba a haɗa shi da ajiyar Zinn® ba tukuna, don haka babu inda za a iya matsar da kafofin watsa labarai zuwa gare shi.','%d attachment moved.'=>'An matso da abin da aka makala %d.' . "\0" . 'An matsa da abubuwan haɗawa %d.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage.'=>'Wannan shafin ba shi da alaka da ajiyar Zinn®.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Media stays on this server until it is.'=>'Babu abin da ya faru — kawai ba a haɗa shi ba tukuna. Media ɗin yana zaune a kan wannan sabar har sai an yi hakan.','Connected, but the last upload failed.'=>'An haɗa, amma loda na ƙarshe ya gaza.','Try a batch now'=>'Gwada tsari a yanzu','Connected. Every attachment has been moved.'=>'An haɗa. An ƙaura da duk abubuwan da aka maƙala.','Connected. %1$s of %2$s attachments still on this server.'=>'An haɗa. %1$s daga cikin abubuwan haɗe-haɗe %2$s suna nan a kan wannan uwar garken.','Moved so far'=>'An Matsar da Yanzu','%1$s files, %2$s'=>'%1$s fayiloli, %2$s','Still on this server'=>'Har yanzu a kan wannan uwar garken','%1$s of %2$s attachments'=>'%1$s na %2$s abubuwan da aka makala','Served from'=>'An turo daga','this server'=>'wannan sabar','Connect this site'=>'Haɗa wannan shafin','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Storage → Media offload, and press “Pair a site”. Paste the code below.'=>'Buɗe kwamitin kulawa na Zinn Digital®, je zuwa Adana → Watsa kafofin watsa labarai, sannan ka danna “Haɗa shafin yanar gizo”. Manna lambar da ke ƙasa.','Pairing code'=>'Lambar haɗawa','Disconnect this site'=>'Cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizon','New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change.'=>'Sabbin abubuwan da aka loda za su zauna a kan wannan sabar. Watsa labarai da aka riga aka matsar za su ci gaba da aiki - adireshinsu ba ya canzawa.','You do not have permission to manage this site.'=>'Ba ka da izinin sarrafa wannan shafin.','Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Sanya lambar haɗawa daga allon sarrafa ku na Zinn Digital®.','Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background.'=>'An haɗa. Sabbin abubuwan da aka loda za a adana su tare da Zinn Digital® tun daga yanzu, kuma kafofin watsa labarai na yanzu za su motsa a baya.','Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server.'=>'An cire haɗi. Kafofin watsa labarai da aka riga aka matsar na ci gaba da aiki; sabbin abubuwan da aka loda suna zaune a kan wannan sabar.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan fayil din daga wannan uwar garken ba, don haka ba a loda komai ba.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya watsa abin da aka loda ba, don haka ba a tura komai ba.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Wannan fayil din %1$s ne kuma PHP na wannan shafin ba shi da cURL, don haka mafi girman abin da zai iya lodawa shine %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'Ba a iya kammala lodawa ba.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Ajiya ta ki amincewa da loda (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Tsarin salo','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Wuri mai farawa. Duk abin da ke ƙasa ya ɓata shi.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Yi amfani da launuka da girmofi na kaina','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Bar wannan a kashe kuma ana amfani da saitaccen tsari yadda yake ainihi.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan fitowar Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka sauke ta gaza gwajin inganci kuma ba a sanya ta ba.']];